message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "xspace-AI"
abstract: "TypeScript SDK and CLI for building AI agents that autonomously join, listen, and speak in X/Twitter Spaces. Supports multiple LLM providers (OpenAI, Claude, Groq), speech-to-text (Whisper, Deepgram), text-to-speech (ElevenLabs, OpenAI), multi-agent coordination, middleware pipelines, and a real-time admin dashboard. No Twitter API approval needed"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/xspace-AI"
